      "id": 1,
      "text": "Settled in the mid-1800s, La Union was born from the merging of two historic pueblos, Los Ojitos and Los Amoles.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
